"Tobin's elder brother Aren went for a Sheem levy last autumn and is one of the watchtower runaways."
"Barek quietly leaves cheese for the runaways so they spare his own flock."
"Joss the carrier sells the runaways' stolen fleeces in Imra and keeps a third."
"Mother Hesra lost her apprentice to winter fever and wants a quick pair of hands."
"Under a loose board in the Ram and Kettle's loft lie four silver talents a dead drover hid."
